WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.840
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:09.600
Telling new researchers that you can tame SCP-682&nbsp;
with a rolled-up newspaper and a tummy rub.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.080
When you’ve been alive for as long as Dr. Bright,&nbsp;
with the knowledge of eternity stretching out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.720
before you, you can watch every movie and&nbsp;
show, play every game, and read every book.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.120
That’s why Dr. Bright sometimes resorts&nbsp;
to more esoteric methods of amusement.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.640
Such as feeding the newbies little white lies&nbsp;
about anomalies, like telling them SCP-682 can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:33.040
be tamed with a rolled-up newspaper and&nbsp;
tummy rubs, like a misbehaving puppy.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:37.680
Which must have seemed really funny&nbsp;
until six new researchers got devoured.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:42.320
And considering what a nightmare employee&nbsp;
turnaround is at the SCP Foundation already,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:47.520
losing employees for a reason this stupid&nbsp;
really didn’t sit well with the O5 Council…

